<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 68.3865 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 68.3865 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 68.3865 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 68.1420 on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    Sep 2		   Aug 29</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     68.3865		 68.1420</p>
<p> volume ($ million)		  9.925		  10.705</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
